# Optional. `yarn pulumi`, `yarn preview`, `yarn deploy` and `yarn bootstrap`
# read the stack passphrase from 1Password — `op://<your vault>/keel/password`,
# the vault being the one `src/config/installation.ts` names — unless it is set
# in the environment or here. Copy to `.env` only on a machine with no vault.
PULUMI_CONFIG_PASSPHRASE=
